Experienced players make wishes like this all the time, because they
know that very few parts of the ascension kit are actually 'necessary'.
I'm by no means one of the top players around, but over the course of
36 ascensions, I've wished for a bag of holding 8 times and 7 candles 7
times. Likely there weren't many games where I wished for both, but
