that high. Most of my candle wishes were just because I was too lazy to
walk back up to minetown and buy them, since I forgot before ascending;
had I actually valued the wish that much, I could have gone back up and
got the candles, and come back down again. But I didn't, because games
typically don't require very many wishes.

